<template>
<div class="ai-set-head"><h2>AI 供应商设置</h2><button type="button" id="aiSetClose" class="ai-icon-btn" aria-label="关闭供应商设置" title="关闭供应商设置">×</button></div><p class="ai-set-hint">像 ZCode 自定义厂商那样填：选接口格式 → 填地址 / Key / 模型。地址只填到版本号，路径后缀由格式自动拼接。密钥只保存在本机浏览器。</p><label>接口格式<select id="aiSetFormat"><option value="openai-chat">OpenAI · Chat Completions（主流）</option><option value="openai-responses">OpenAI · Responses（新版 GPT-5）</option><option value="anthropic">Anthropic · Messages（Claude）</option></select><span class="ai-set-suffix" id="aiSetSuffix"></span></label><label>接口地址<input id="aiSetUrl" type="text" spellcheck="false" placeholder="https://api.openai.com/v1" /></label><label>API Key<input id="aiSetKey" type="password" spellcheck="false" placeholder="sk-…" autocomplete="off" /></label><label>模型 ID<input id="aiSetModel" type="text" spellcheck="false" placeholder="例如 gpt-5.1 / claude-opus-4-5" /></label><div class="ai-set-row"><label>思考深度<select id="aiSetEffort"><option value="off">关闭</option><option value="minimal">极快</option><option value="low">低</option><option value="medium">中</option><option value="high">高</option></select></label><label class="ai-set-check"><input id="aiSetStream" type="checkbox" /> 流式输出</label></div><label>附加请求字段（可选，JSON）<textarea id="aiSetExtra" rows="2" spellcheck="false" placeholder='{"temperature":0.2}'></textarea></label><div class="ai-set-test"><button type="button" class="ai-btn-ghost" id="aiSetTest">测试连接</button><span id="aiSetTestOut"></span></div><div class="ai-set-actions"><button type="button" class="ai-btn-ghost" id="aiSetCancel">取消</button><button type="submit" class="ai-btn-primary" id="aiSetSave">保存并关闭</button></div>
</template>
